# Local Claude Code instructions — private, not for the public repo.
CLAUDE.md

# Local docker-compose customisation. The override switches the stack to
# Google auth and .env holds the real client secret; neither belongs in the
# repo. Committing the override would also flip `docker compose up` to
# Google mode for everyone and break the Playwright suite, which drives the
# basic-auth login form. See the two .example files next to them.
docker-compose.override.yml
.env
